  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provectus SEE Fund II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed transaction is an equity commitment of up to &#x20ac;25 million in favour  of Provectus SEE Fund II (the &quot;Fund&quot;).  The Fund will make equity and equity related investments in SMEs primarily in  Croatia, Slovenia, Romania and Bulgaria, and to a lesser extent Albania, Bosnia  and Herzegovina, Greece, Hungary, Kosovo, Montenegro, North Macedonia and  Serbia (collectively the &quot;Region&quot;), with the objective of generating long-term  capital appreciation.</narrative>
  </description>
